285
00:22:05,990 --> 00:22:08,660
Pink copies to accounting,
fuchsia ones to Roz.

286
00:22:08,740 --> 00:22:10,740
The fuchsia ones go to purchasing.

287
00:22:10,910 --> 00:22:12,580
The goldenrod ones go to Roz.

